          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Rehoboamu bye yakola, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo eky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera ekyo kyonakyona, ghaabangagho entalo edhomwidhirano ghagati gha Rehoboamu ni Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa. Yaaziikibwa mu lwambiidhi lwa badhaadha be abo, mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi. Inhina wa Rehoboamu yali ng'ayetebwa Naama, era nga Muammoni. Mutabane wa Rehoboamu oyo eyayetebwanga Abiyamu, n'eyasikira ise oyo ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
